<details style="margin-top:12px;border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fff7f7;padding:12px;border-radius:11px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;color:#b91c1c;font-weight:800">Cancelar NFS-e e liberar todas as O.S. deste lote</summary>
